  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening BIHR&apos;s Rapid Response to Israeli Annexation Measures in oPt with a Bethlehem Focus</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will increase the Balasan Initiative for Human Rights&apos; capacity to provide a robust legal and advocacy response to escalating Israeli annexation measures and human rights violations, particularly within the Christian population in Bethlehem Governorate.  The grant will support two areas of activity (i) strengthening BIHR&apos;s organisational capacity through funding one new staff post, 2 existing staff posts, a new laptop &amp; printer, and upgrading office furniture; (ii) increasing BIHR&apos;s international advocacy work through an advocacy visit to the UK by the Director in early 2026, and supporting the publication and dissemination of legal advocacy updates.</narrative>
  </description>
